# tally 2.2.1 P35 (L §8.2 l.2248, "an entry is listed under a result exactly when a read in its set gave it", whatever
# the form of the line, its outcome, or the way a movement came not to count): N1, a balance before a leg whose day row is assumed lists
# assumed: (review g2 reg/r8). Before W8: before no line.
=== r8.tally
model r8
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place sav: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input w: date
input w3: date
input pay: money PLN
move pw: transfers
  on w
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay
move ps: transfers
  on w3
  leg cash from world to sav amount pay
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pay = 100.00 PLN assumed "the card names no pay"
  w = 2026-03-10 assumed "the card names no day"
  w3 = 2026-03-10 "s"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[sav] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
ask before: bal(konto, 2026-03-07)
ask after: bal(konto, 2026-03-12)
ask fbefore: flows(konto, 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-07)
ask fafter: flows(konto, 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-12)
ask pbefore: bal(konto, 2026-03-07) with w = 2026-03-09
ask cbefore: count(m in transfers over 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-07)
ask prj: bal(konto, 2026-03-07) from 2026-03-01
=== expect before after
before: 500.00 PLN
  assumed: the card names no day (w)
  cut 2026-01-01
after: 600.00 PLN
  assumed: the card names no day (w)
  assumed: the card names no pay (pay)
  cut 2026-01-01
